  "description": "Pocket AI - Edge Gallery, Your private, on-device AI assistant for everyday tasks, powerful tools, and advanced language models.\n\nRun cutting-edge open-source AI models directly on your phone—no cloud, no data sharing, and no delays. From daily tasks to deep reasoning, transforms your device into a fast, secure, and fully personal AI agent.\n\nNow Supporting Gemma 4\nExperience the latest generation of on-device AI with official support for the Gemma 4 family.\nEnjoy stronger reasoning, smarter responses, and enhanced creativity—all running locally on your device.\n\nCore Features\n1. AI Agent with Skills\nGo beyond chat. Turn AI into action.\nUse built-in tools like maps, knowledge search, and structured summaries—or extend capabilities with modular skills. Load custom skills via URL or explore community contributions.\n\n2. AI Chat with Thinking Mode\nHave natural, multi-turn conversations with powerful LLMs.\nEnable Thinking Mode to explore how the model reasons step by step—ideal for problem-solving, learning, and advanced queries.\n(Available for supported models such as Gemma 4)\n\n3. Flexible Model Management\nDownload and run a wide range of open-source models, or import your own.\nTest, compare, and manage models easily to find what works best on your device.\n\n4. 100% On-Device Privacy\nYour data stays with you.\nAll processing happens locally on your device—no internet required, no data uploaded, complete privacy guaranteed.\n\nWhy Pocket AI ?\n1. Fully offline AI experience\n2. Fast, local inference with no latency\n3. Expandable skills and tools ecosystem\n4. Designed for both everyday users and AI enthusiasts\n\nTurn your phone into a powerful AI agent—private, fast, and always available.",
